cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "fluidnet: graph-first steady-state fluid network simulation"
abstract: >-
  A Python library for steady-state simulation of fluid networks, built on a
  graph-first architecture with a polymorphic rate abstraction that propagates
  composition through the network and pluggable, physics-agnostic loss
  functions. Designed for field calibration of network parameters against
  operational observations.
type: software
